# Source distributions must carry the runtime prompt registry: services/tutor.py
# reads prompts/manifest.json at import time (A5-02), and a registry without
# the .md files beside it is a loud boot failure by design. The directory lives
# outside the import package, so it cannot ride the wheel as package-data; the
# Docker image ships it and sets BANGLA_GPT_PROMPTS_DIR (see ../Dockerfile),
# and this manifest keeps sdists from losing it.
recursive-include prompts *.md *.json
